# A1/A1.1/A1_05_work_and_days.letz
# Source: Quizlet "A1 Basics Beginner Luxembourgish Lesson 5"
#   https://quizlet.com/_h2swfv
# Slash variants and bracket alternatives split into atomic pairs;
# (formal)/(informal)/(male) qualifiers stripped;
# (with the) and "to do sports/to work out" alternatives split across multiple variants.

@lesson A1.05 "Work & Days"

# --- Days of the week (Quizlet cards 31-37) ---
@word Méindeg = Monday
@word Dënschdeg = Tuesday
@word Mëttwoch = Wednesday
@word Donneschdeg = Thursday
@word Freideg = Friday
@word Samschdeg = Saturday
@word Sonndeg = Sunday

# --- Daily routine verbs (Quizlet cards 38-48) ---
@word opstoen = to get up
@word Zänn wäschen = to brush teeth
@word Sport maachen = to do sports
@word Sport maachen = to work out
@word an d'Dusch goen = to go for a shower
@word d'Hoer kämmen = to brush hair
@word Kaffi drénken = to have breakfast
@word schaffe goen = to go to work
@word akafe goen = to go shopping
@word zu Mëtteg iessen = to have lunch
@word zu Nuecht iessen = to have dinner
@word schlofe goen = to go to sleep

# --- Vocabulary from sentences (coverage backfill) ---
@word d'Bank = bank
@word d'Post = post office
@word d'Leit = people
@word de Projet = project
@word de Bus = bus
@word den Telefon = telephone
@word de Staat = state
@word de Plang = plan
@word de Direkter = director
@word d'Strategie = strategy
@word de Ministère = ministry
@word de Coiffer = hairdresser
@word den Enkel = grandchild

# --- Sentences (Quizlet cards 1-30) ---

